{"version":1,"content":"<p>42歲加拿大搖滾天后Avril Lavigne社交網站久未更新，上一次更新已是上年10月，昨日（13日）卻無預警宣布榮升母親，誕下首胎，爆粗表示：「我哋嘅迷你XX公主嚟到啦！</p><p>」她上載3張黑白照，其中她抱住B女、握住B女小手、與滑板上放上三對</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:18:03.206175+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:45:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T02:11:06.448536+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T02:11:06.448536+00:00","content_hash":"881236f2dc48b631fca2e8d6d0d14f04300e6a90621b61343adfa0695c73329c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}